<title>JAPAN: Matsushita - 6mth group results.</title>
<headline>Matsushita - 6mth group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  3.60 trln	 vs	    3.22 trln</p>
<p> Operating	  130.40		vs	   91.30</p>
<p> Pretax	prft 119.90		vs    loss 81.00</p>
<p> Net	    prft 42.60		vs   loss 132.90</p>
<p> EPS	    prft 18.97 yen	  vs    loss 63.36 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Matsushita Electric Industrial Co Ltd is a large consumer electronics manufacturer.</p>
</text>
